### Development

#### CI actions updated to current majors

Workflow actions moved to their current major releases: `actions/checkout` v7,
`astral-sh/setup-uv` v9.0.0, `codecov/codecov-action` v7, and
`dorny/paths-filter` v4. Workflow behavior is unchanged, though setup-uv no
longer prunes the uv cache, so the first run after this repopulates it.

#### Lint floor moved to ruff 0.16 (#10)

Minimum `ruff>=0.16.0` (was unpinned). 0.16.0 stabilizes
`none-not-at-end-of-union` (`RUF036`) out of preview, and starts formatting
Python code blocks inside Markdown, so `ruff format` now covers the docs tree
alongside `src/`.

The rule selection also reaches ruff for the first time: it lived under a
table name ruff does not read, so linting ran against ruff's built-in
defaults. The configured prefixes — pydocstyle, isort, `flake8-use-pathlib`
and the rest — are now enforced as written.
